{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgmg1EY8mhaawmfF554DD","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I didn't pick anything today. I'll ask you first, and maybe someone at the bank too. Here's how it went.\n\n**What I decided:** Nothing yet. I'm fairly sure that's right. What decided it: I didn't recognise one company name. The ones I saw were \"מור\", \"אנליסט\" and \"מיטב\", and I didn't see any bank I know. I wouldn't give our money to a company I've never heard of. The whole page is one long black table full of numbers, and I couldn't tell which line is as safe as our deposits.\n\n**What I looked at, in order:**\n1. The heading \"כל המסלולים בכל החברות\" and the green button \"קופת גמל להשקעה 143\". There was an orange box saying \"נתוני הרשות לא עודכנו מאז ספטמבר 2026\", and I couldn't tell if that's a problem.\n2. Rows of buttons. I recognised \"אג\"ח ממשלתי 3\" and \"אג\"ח ממשלתי סחיר 1\", because government bonds are safe. But it's only a picture, I couldn't press anything, and all around them were things like \"s&p 500\" and \"עוקב מדד\".\n3. The table. The first rows had no company name above them, so I don't know whose they are. After that came \"מור\", then \"אנליסט\", then \"מיטב\".\n   - Most lines are about shares.\n   - The ones that sounded gentle were \"כספי (שקלי)\", about 4.3% to 4.4% for \"3 שנים\", and \"אשראי ואג\"ח\", about 5.4% or 6%.\n   - The 4.3% stuck with me, but I don't know if it's more than the bank gives us on the deposit. Next to it it says \"לפני דמי ניהול\", so the fee comes off after that.\n   - Most lines just say \"פחות מ־3 שנים\" with no number at all.\n   - The fees run from 0.54% to about 0.73% \"מהחיסכון\". I suppose that's taken every year, but I'm not sure.\n\nI stopped after the sixth screen. There were nine more, and I didn't look at them.\n\n**Words I didn't understand:** \"s&p 500\" / \"S&P500\", \"עוקב מדד\", \"עוקב מדדים - גמיש\", \"סחיר\", \"מט\"ח\" with a percentage, \"חשיפה\", \"קופה\" with numbers like 15286, \"חדש\", and \"123 מקורו / מחושב / הזנתה\". One line said shares were \"101%\", and I don't see how something can be more than everything. There were also little circles in turquoise and yellow that I didn't try to read.\n\n**What was hard:**\n- The grey writing on black at the top, under the heading, and in the column titles is pale and small.\n- The lines are long, so I lost my place between the name on the right and the numbers on the left.\n- I got anxious by the third screen with all those numbers, and by the sixth I'd had enough."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1895,"cache_read_input_tokens":13683,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1895},"output_tokens":5,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"2611e45f-0473-48f1-ac42-809fefa43a6a","uuid":"129f551c-c07e-4e5b-8849-49c67efa6762","timestamp":"2026-11-06T12:27:43.711Z","request_id":"req_011Cgmg1EHmBSXsEhjSWHVkT"}
